CORE
main.c
--show-value-sets
activate-multi-line-match
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
\nq = \{[^}]*<x, 0, signedbv\[32\]>
\nq = \{[^}]*<y, 0, signedbv\[32\]>
--
^warning: ignoring
--
q is null until the inline assembly, which may store in q the address of any
object reachable from the objects of static lifetime (x, through p) or whose
address is stored in a variable (y, through local_p).
